/* Chinese (Simplified). */

/* AppDelegate */
"Let Screen Line handle your screenshots?" = "让 Screen Line 接管你的截图？";
"Screenshots will hang on the line the instant you take them, without the floating thumbnail, and will not pile up on your Desktop. Drag one to a folder to keep it, or discard it with the cross. You can turn this off from the menu bar, and your settings come back when Screen Line quits." = "你截图的那一瞬间，图片就会挂到晾衣绳上——没有浮动缩略图，也不会堆到桌面上。拖进文件夹即保留，点叉即丢弃。随时可以从菜单栏关掉，退出 Screen Line 后你的设置会自动还原。";
"Turn on" = "开启";
"Not now" = "以后再说";
"Quit Screen Line" = "退出 Screen Line";
"Could not change the login setting" = "无法更改登录项设置";
"Move Screen Line to the Applications folder and try again." = "请先把 Screen Line 移到「应用程序」文件夹，再试一次。";
"Watch" = "监视";
"New images saved to this folder will hang on the line." = "保存到此文件夹的新图片会挂到晾衣绳上。";
"Change Shortcut" = "更改快捷键";
"Space" = "空格";
"Press the new shortcut" = "请按下新的快捷键";
"Escape cancels. Delete removes the shortcut." = "按 Esc 取消，按删除键移除快捷键。";
"The line is empty" = "晾衣绳上是空的";
"%d on the line" = "晾衣绳上有 %d 张";

